stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NOT_QUEUED : new plan (Draft – not sent)
  NOT_QUEUED --> PENDING : markComplete() valid
  PENDING --> SYNCING : signal + runOnce()
  SYNCING --> PENDING : no signal (attempt not counted)
  SYNCING --> SYNCHRONISED : 200/201, baseRev = rev
  SYNCING --> PENDING : 5xx, attempts < 3
  SYNCING --> FAILED : 5xx, attempts = 3 / 4xx refused
  SYNCING --> CONFLICT : 412 server copy changed
  FAILED --> PENDING : Retry sending
  CONFLICT --> PENDING : Keep this phone's version (re-base on server rev)
  CONFLICT --> SYNCHRONISED : Use outreach unit copy
  SYNCHRONISED --> NOT_QUEUED : Edit plan (reopen)
  note right of PENDING : shown as "Waiting for signal"
  note right of CONFLICT : shown as "Needs your choice"
